<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Maven - 标签 - Luhong's Blog</title><link>https://blog.luhg.cn/tags/maven/</link><description>Maven - 标签 - Luhong's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.luhg.cn/tags/maven/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>创建 Dubbo 多模块项目</title><link>https://blog.luhg.cn/03-%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BAdubbo%E5%A4%9A%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>Luhong</author><guid>https://blog.luhg.cn/03-%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BAdubbo%E5%A4%9A%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h1 id="创建-dubbo-多模块项目">创建 Dubbo 多模块项目</h1>
<p>目标：建立一个父项目和三个模块，分离接口契约、提供者和消费者。</p>
<h2 id="1-目录结构">1. 目录结构</h2>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-text">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">dubbo-demo/
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">├── pom.xml
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">├── dubbo-api/
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">│   └── pom.xml
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">├── user-provider/
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">│   └── pom.xml
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">└── order-consumer/
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    └── pom.xml</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h2 id="2-父项目-pomxml">2. 父项目 <code>pom.xml</code></h2>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-xml">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-xml" data-lang="xml"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nt">&lt;project</span> <span class="na">xmlns=</span><span class="s">&#34;http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">         <span class="na">xmlns:xsi=</span><span class="s">&#34;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">         <span class="na">xsi:schemaLocation=</span><span class="s">&#34;http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="s">         https://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd&#34;</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;modelVersion&gt;</span>4.0.0<span class="nt">&lt;/modelVersion&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;groupId&gt;</span>com.example<span class="nt">&lt;/groupId&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;artifactId&gt;</span>dubbo-demo<span class="nt">&lt;/artifactId&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;version&gt;</span>1.0.0<span class="nt">&lt;/version&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;packaging&gt;</span>pom<span class="nt">&lt;/packaging&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;modules&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nt">&lt;module&gt;</span>dubbo-api<span class="nt">&lt;/module&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nt">&lt;module&gt;</span>user-provider<span class="nt">&lt;/module&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nt">&lt;module&gt;</span>order-consumer<span class="nt">&lt;/module&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;/modules&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;properties&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nt">&lt;java.version&gt;</span>17<span class="nt">&lt;/java.version&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nt">&lt;spring-boot.version&gt;</span>3.3.0<span class="nt">&lt;/spring-boot.version&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nt">&lt;dubbo.version&gt;</span>3.3.0<span class="nt">&lt;/dubbo.version&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;/properties&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nt">&lt;/project&gt;</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>这是用于教学的简化父 POM。真实项目通常还会使用 Spring Boot 的 BOM、统一插件版本、代码检查和依赖收敛规则。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>创建 Java Maven 项目</title><link>https://blog.luhg.cn/03-%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BAjava-maven%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>Luhong</author><guid>https://blog.luhg.cn/03-%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BAjava-maven%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h1 id="创建-java-maven-项目">创建 Java Maven 项目</h1>
<p>目标：创建一个可以连接本地 Kafka 的 Java 项目，并确认依赖下载成功。</p>
<h2 id="1-创建目录">1. 创建目录</h2>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-text">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">kafka-java-demo/
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">├── pom.xml
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">└── src/main/java/com/example/kafka/</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h2 id="2-编写-pomxml">2. 编写 <code>pom.xml</code></h2>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-xml">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-xml" data-lang="xml"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nt">&lt;project</span> <span class="na">xmlns=</span><span class="s">&#34;http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">         <span class="na">xmlns:xsi=</span><span class="s">&#34;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">         <span class="na">xsi:schemaLocation=</span><span class="s">&#34;http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="s">         https://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd&#34;</span><span class="nt">&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;modelVersion&gt;</span>4.0.0<span class="nt">&lt;/modelVersion&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;groupId&gt;</span>com.example<span class="nt">&lt;/groupId&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;artifactId&gt;</span>kafka-java-demo<span class="nt">&lt;/artifactId&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;version&gt;</span>1.0.0<span class="nt">&lt;/version&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;properties&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nt">&lt;maven.compiler.release&gt;</span>17<span class="nt">&lt;/maven.compiler.release&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nt">&lt;project.build.sourceEncoding&gt;</span>UTF-8<span class="nt">&lt;/project.build.sourceEncoding&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;/properties&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;dependencies&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nt">&lt;dependency&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="nt">&lt;groupId&gt;</span>org.apache.kafka<span class="nt">&lt;/groupId&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="nt">&lt;artifactId&gt;</span>kafka-clients<span class="nt">&lt;/artifactId&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="nt">&lt;version&gt;</span>3.9.1<span class="nt">&lt;/version&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nt">&lt;/dependency&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nt">&lt;dependency&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="nt">&lt;groupId&gt;</span>org.slf4j<span class="nt">&lt;/groupId&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="nt">&lt;artifactId&gt;</span>slf4j-simple<span class="nt">&lt;/artifactId&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="nt">&lt;version&gt;</span>2.0.16<span class="nt">&lt;/version&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nt">&lt;/dependency&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nt">&lt;/dependencies&gt;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nt">&lt;/project&gt;</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p><code>kafka-clients</code> 是 Kafka 官方 Java 客户端。<code>slf4j-simple</code> 只是让本地运行时能看到必要日志，真实项目通常由 Spring Boot 或公司日志框架统一管理。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>09-构建 Java 项目并发布制品</title><link>https://blog.luhg.cn/09-%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BAjava%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E5%88%B6%E5%93%81/</link><pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>Luhong</author><guid>https://blog.luhg.cn/09-%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BAjava%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E5%88%B6%E5%93%81/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h1 id="09-构建-java-项目并发布制品">09-构建 Java 项目并发布制品</h1>
<p>本章以 Maven 项目为例，完成“拉代码 -&gt; 测试 -&gt; 打包 -&gt; 保存 jar”的持续集成流程。</p>
<h2 id="推荐使用-maven-wrapper">推荐使用 Maven Wrapper</h2>
<p>项目中若有 <code>mvnw</code> 和 <code>.mvn/</code>，优先使用：</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-bash">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">./mvnw <span class="nb">test</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">./mvnw package</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>这样项目会固定 Maven 版本，减少“本地能跑、Jenkins 不能跑”的环境差异。</p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>